    "description": "This dataset contains oceanographic data collected from NOAA Ship OKEANOS EXPLORER in the North Atlantic Ocean from 2018-05-22 to 2018-06-06. Data acquisition from shipboard sensors includes navigational data, meteorological data (conductivity, depth, echo sounder, temperature, wind, wind speed), and oceanographic data (bathythermograph, salinity, sound velocity probe, thermosalinograph). Additional data include Profile Data (ASVP, CTD, and XBT).",
